From 5187d1e7694b79e2f09a031f15e5ce33112076bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:23:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/29] Open the Bilibili live room from the LiveHime dock

The ready account view gains an area picker and Go live / End live.
Go live asks the core to open the room (startLive, v0.1.2's signing) and
hands the returned RTMP endpoint to the StreamController; End live stops
OBS and closes the room together, then re-reads the room status. Face
verification, expired logins and API refusals are reported in place
without signing out, and logging out is disabled while live so a room is
never left running.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
